  "description": {
   "en": "Sakuma Shiyori is a loner high school girl who's not good at introducing herself. She lives her life as a loner, desperately concealing her beloved hobby of \"drawing yuri illustrations of 2D idols.\" However, she suddenly ends up sharing a ”secret” with the overly serious Katori-sensei…!?\n\nWon a Selection and TOP Award from the 481st Young Magazine Monthly Newcomer Manga Awards (May 2020).\n___\n**Alt Official Raws:** [YanMaga Web](https://yanmaga.jp/viewer/comics/%E6%9C%88%E9%96%93%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%BA%E8%B3%9E_%E5%8F%97%E8%B3%9E%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E7%AC%AC455%E5%9B%9E%E7%AC%AC511%E5%9B%9E/333ce87a218243cec8fa590a25d690aa?cid=06Z0000000000300FREE), [X](https://x.com/yanmaga_new/status/1633286791527813122)"
